feat(auth): full authentication & role-based authorization with Neon PostgreSQL

- Connect Neon PostgreSQL database and push all 15 Prisma tables
- Seed database with 4 roles (VISITOR, USER, ORGANIZER, ADMIN), 3 test users, 8 categories, 2 events
- Implement Zod validation schemas for registration, login, password reset
- Implement authenticate middleware (HTTP-only cookies + Bearer token)
- Implement authorize middleware for Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)
- Implement full auth controller: register, login, refresh, logout, getMe, forgotPassword, resetPassword, verifyEmail
- Wire up /api/auth routes with rate limiting
- Verified with automated end-to-end smoke tests (all passing)
